00aMicro REMOVED_DATE  serial sections, multi frags, ESS. \u000aMicro 18&19: inferior margin, perpendicular, 8 frags, ESS. \u000apsc \u000aReports to: SHOJI, BRENT, T. M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
