ette (arbitrary) contains cores aggregating REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE \u000acm, entirely submitted in micro cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . The third B cassette (arbitrary) \u000acontains cores aggregating REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.2cm  entirely submitted in micro \u000acassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . The fourth B cassette (arbitrary) contains cores aggregating REMOVED_DATE \u000ax REMOVED_DATE x 0.2cm  entirely submitted in micro cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . The fifth B cassette \u000a(arbitrary) contains cores aggregating REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.2cm  entirely submitted \u000ain micro cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000aTissue will be held for further fixation prior to processing. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Cassette A cores, multi frags, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Cassette B cores, multi frags in each, ESS. \u000aDB/mmm \u000aCASE NUMBER:  REMOVED_CASE_ID  \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on \u000a11/3/ REMOVED_CASE_ID  \u000a[report_end] 
