ue (628 \u000agram, REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 4.0cm in aggregate). The fragments are sectioned to \u000aexhibit approximately 20% unremarkable white/tan fibrous stroma and 80% \u000ayellow/tan lobulated adipose tissue with no discrete masses or lesions grossly \u000aidentified. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Skin and fibrous stroma, multi frags, RSS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Breast and fibrous stroma, multi frags, RSS. \u000aLMB/ajb \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Gilbert Brodsky M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end] 
