men is serially sectioned from lateral to medial revealing \u000adense fibrous breast parenchyma consisting of 80% fibrous tissue and 20% \u000aadipose tissue. A clip is identified within the specimen with adjacent \u000ahemorrhage and fibrosis consistent with core biopsy site changes. The entire \u000aspecimen is submitted for histological evaluation. \u000aMicro 1: lateral margin, multi frags, ESS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  remainder of specimen, submitted from lateral to medial (clip \u000awithin micro 5), multi frags, ESS. \u000ajs \u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
