g up to 0.5cm in \u000agreatest dimension are identified but no definitive mass is located. The \u000atissue is entirely submitted. \u000aMicros REMOVED_DATE  main body of mass, multi margins, ESS. \u000aMicros REMOVED_DATE  medial arm coming off main specimen, 6 frags, ESS. \u000aMicros REMOVED_DATE  3 frags of unoriented tissue, black demarks unknown margin, \u000amulti frags, ESS. \u000aafl \u000aReports to: JACOBSEN, DAVID M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
