ss only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aResident Review by Eric J Burks M.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aFinal Review by Tan A Ince M.D., Ph.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Tan A Ince M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on \u000a12/15/ REMOVED_CASE_ID  \u000a[report_end] 
