ssue with marked cystic changes in white fibrous tissue. There are no \u000agrossly firm areas in the specimen. \u000aMicros #13-29: 80% of fibrous tissue, 17 frag, RSS. \u000aReports to: RANDALL, SHELDON M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS \u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS \u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
