tains multiple areas of firm, indurated, gritty, light grey, suspicious \u000asoft tissue, in maximal size measuring 0.5cm  \u000aMICRO #9-11: Entirety of the second specimen, mult frags, 3 cass, ESS. \u000aReports to: DAVIS, SALLIE, KEENE M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
