ION: \u000aReceived from Salem Hospital, Department of Pathology, 81 Highland Avenue, \u000aSalem, MA  REMOVED_CASE_ID  are thirteen (13) slides. \u000aThree (3) slides are labeled "SS-04- REMOVED_CASE_ID ", sublabeled " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " through " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", \u000acorresponding to A) right breast core biopsy; B) right breast core biopsy; C) \u000aright breast core biopsy obtained from a procedure performed on REMOVED_DATE  \u000aaccording to the accompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name. \u000aEight (8) slides are labeled "SS-04- REMOVED_CASE_ID ", sublabeled " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " through " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", \u000acorresponding to a right breast excisional biopsy with margin evaluation \u000a(superior) (4 x REMOVED_DATE x 2.3cm ) obtained from a procedure performed on \u000a12/14/ REMOVED_CASE_ID , according to the accompanying pathology report bearing the \u000apatient's name. Subsequently received are 3 HE levels of slide  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and the \u000aparaffin block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . The block is not recut. \u000aOne (1) slide is labeled " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", sublabeled " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", corresponding to fine \u000aneedle aspiration, right breast obtained from a procedure performed on \u000a11/29/ REMOVED_CASE_ID , according to the accompanying cytopathology report bearing the \u000apatient's name (outside diagnosis: cystic change and apocrine metaplasia). \u000aThese slides will be referred to the Cytology Division. \u000aOne (1) slide is labeled "" REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", sublabeled " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", corresponding to a \u000afine needle aspiration, right breast, 9 o'clock position obtained from a \u000aprocedure performed on REMOVED_DATE  according to the accompanying cytopathology \u000areport bearing the patient's name (outside diagnosis: inflamed cyst contents). \u000aThis slide will be referred to the Cytology Division. \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aMicroscopic/Diagnostic Dictation by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on \u000a1/10/ REMOVED_CASE_ID  \u000a[report_end] 
