beled " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " and sublabeled "1  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", "2  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " and "2 \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", corresponding to 1) right breast, 10 o'clock, core biopsy (0.4 x 0.1cm ) \u000a2) left breast, 3 o'clock, core biopsy (0.4 x 1.0cm ) performed on REMOVED_DATE  \u000aaccording to the accompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name. \u000aReceived from North Shore Pathologists, P.C., Salem Hospital, Pathology \u000aDepartment, 81 Highland Avenue, Salem, MA  REMOVED_CASE_ID , are three (3) glass slides. \u000aThe slides are labeled "SS-06- REMOVED_CASE_ID " and sublabeled " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " and " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", \u000acorresponding to a left breast wide excision (3.0 x REMOVED_DATE x 2.0cm ) performed on \u000a6/12/06, according to the accompanying pathology report bearing the patient's \u000aname. \u000aIncluded is a consultation report from North Shore Pathologists, P.C., numbered \u000a"US-06- REMOVED_CASE_ID " and dated REMOVED_DATE  referring to the case listed above \u000a"S- REMOVED_CASE_ID -06", bearing the patient's name. \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Tan A Ince M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on \u000a8/11/ REMOVED_CASE_ID  \u000a[report_end] 
