te is labeled "B", contains multiple cylindrical focally \u000ahemorrhagic fibrofatty soft tissues (1.5 x REMOVED_DATE x 0.3cm ). The specimen is \u000asubmitted in toto. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Contents of pink cassette labeled "A", multi frags, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Contents of pink cassette labeled "B", multi frags, ESS. \u000ajc/lp \u000aCASE NUMBER:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Jane E. Brock M.B., B.S., Ph.D., Electronically signed on \u000aMonday August 10,  REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 03:50:20PM \u000a[report_end] 
