imen has approximately \u000a20% fibrous tissue and the rest is adipose. The specimen is entirely submitted. \u000aMicro 1: medial, inferior margins, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro 2: posterior, medial, inferior margins, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro 3: lesion with inferior-medial margins, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro 4: lesion with medial, inferior, anterior and posterior margins, \u000a2 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro 5: lesion with inferior, posterior margins, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro 6: posterior, inferior margins, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro 7: superior, anterior, inferior margins, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro 8: superior, inferior, anterior margins, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro 9: lateral margin, 1 frag, ESS. \u000ajdr \u000aReports to: LOCKHART, DIANE, CATHERINE M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
