ontains mutliple \u000ayellow/tan fibrofatty soft tissue cores (1.1 x REMOVED_DATE x 0.3cm in aggregate). The \u000athird blue cassette labeled "C" contains multiple yellow/tan, focally \u000ahemorrhagic, fibrofatty soft tissue cores (1.7 x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm in aggregate). \u000aMicro 1: "A ca++", multi frags, ESS. \u000aMicro 2: "B ca++", multi frags, ESS. \u000aMicro 3: "C", multi frags, ESS. \u000adfi \u000aReports to: BABAGBEMI, T.KEMI M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES) \u000a[report_end] 
