s. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Biopsy cavity, RSS, 4 frag, 4 cass. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Upper outer, upper inner, lower outer, and lower inner quadrants, \u000arespectively, RSS, 4 frag, 4 cass. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Deep margin, RSS, 2 frag, 2 cass. \u000aMicro 14: Additional section of fibrous tissue. \u000akjb \u000aReports to: GARCIA, JOSE, PEREZ M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST MASTECTOMY W/REGIONAL LYMPH NODES \u000a[report_end] 
