 = posterior, yellow = \u000alateral. There is a firm gritty tan/yellow soft tissue which is grossly away \u000afrom all margins. There are no areas grossly consistent with invasive \u000acarcinoma. The specimen is entirely submitted. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast tissue, multiple frags, ESS. \u000aReports to: KAELIN, CAROLYN, MARY M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
