is serially sectioned to reveal a somewhat cystic, \u000airregular shaped mass (1.8 x REMOVED_DATE x 1.8cm ). Areas of the mass are yellow and \u000aresemble fat necrosis grossly. Grossly, the mass lies at the deep and inferior \u000amargins. It lies 1.1cm from the superficial margin, 1.8cm from the medial \u000amargin, 1.4cm from the lateral margin, and 0.3cm from the superficial margin. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  mass in its entirety with margins, multi frags, ESS. \u000aMicro 6: lateral margin, 1 frag, RSS. \u000aMicro 7: medial margin, 1 frag, RSS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  normal appearing breast tissue, 2 frags each cass., RSS. \u000adwa \u000aReports to: CARTER, KATHARINE M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
