 \u000amargin, 2.0cm from the medial margin and 0.2cm from the lateral margin. This \u000anodule corresponds to the area designated on the specimen radiograph. The \u000aspecimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted from medial to lateral. \u000aA specimen radiograph is received with the specimen. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  right breast tissue, mult frags, ESS. The majority of the lesion \u000ais present in cassettes 5 and 6. \u000arp \u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
