ed) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Michael W Bennett M.B., B.C.H., Electronically signed on \u000a7/11/ REMOVED_CASE_ID  \u000a[report_end] 
