a (1.0 x REMOVED_DATE x 0.8cm ), and \u000aadjacent yellow and red hemorrhagic fatty area. The solid area comprises of \u000aapproximately 30% of volume of the specimen. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast tissue, 2 or 1 frag each, ESS \u000ako \u000aReports to: KAELIN, CAROLYN, MARY M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
