ng firm tan/white tissue, the nodule 2.1cm in greatest dimension. \u000aAll specimens are entirely submitted. \u000aSection code: \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  ESS, larger fibroadenoma from 11:00. \u000aMicro 3, ESS, remaining fibroadipose tissue. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  ESS, second right breast tissue fragment at 11:00. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  ESS, right breast mass at 5:00. \u000aReports to: FINLAYSON, WILLIAM, JOHN M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
