0aMicro REMOVED_DATE  fibrous area, 2 fragments, RSS. \u000aReports to: ERIKSSON, ELOF M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST MASTECTOMY - PARTIAL OR SIMPLE \u000a[report_end] 
