; medial = orange. It is 90% \u000afibrous tissue. \u000aMicro 1: anterior margin, 3 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro 2: inferior and anterior margin, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro 3: medial margin, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro 4: inferior margin, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro 5&6: specimen around needle tip, 1 frag each, ESS. \u000aMicro 7: medial margin, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro 8: lateral and inferior margin, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro 9&10: deep and superior margin, 2 frags each, ESS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  additional breast tissue, mult frags, ESS \u000amrk \u000aReports to: IGLEHART, JAMES, DIRK M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
