0% of the fibrous tissue and 40% of the entire specimen \u000ais submitted for microscopic exam). \u000aReports to: NODA, SEIICHI M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
