logic analysis (including all fibrous tissue). \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  lateral inked perpendicular margin, mult frags, RSS \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  medial perpendicular margin, mult frags, RSS \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  representative breast tissue, multi frags, RSS \u000akmg \u000aReports to: SHOJI, BRENT, T. M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
