er quadrant, 1 frag, RSS. \u000aMicro #3 : deep margin from lower inner quadrant, 1 frag, RSS. \u000aMicro #4 : deep margin from lower outer quadrant, 1 frag, RSS. \u000aMicro #5-7 : additional sections of firm area, 1 frag each, RSS. \u000aMicro #8 : nipple, 1 frag, RSS. \u000aMicro #9-15: potential lymph nodes, multiple frags, RSS. \u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST MASTECTOMY W/REGIONAL LYMPH NODES \u000a[report_end] 
