tire specimen is examined microscopically. \u000aThe specimen radiograph is reviewed and reveals a vague nodular density \u000apenetrated by the localizing wire and scattered calcifications within the \u000adensity and in surrounding tissue. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  right breast tissue, mult frags, ESS \u000adl \u000aReports to: CARTER, KATHARINE M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
