rks this cluster of \u000acalcification but also a biopsy clip previously done for a 3mm cluster of fine \u000apleomorphic calcification located in the subareolar region of the right breast. \u000aThe specimen is inked per pathology protocol for the evaluation of margins: \u000aposterior/black; anterior/blue; superior/red; inferior/green; lateral/yellow; \u000amedial/orange. A biopsy cavity with clip is identified in the area of \u000aradiologic calcification. The specimen is serially sectioned from anterior to \u000aposterior to reveal the biopsy cavity mentioned before. The biopsy cavity is \u000alocated at the lateral margin, 0.1cm from the anterior margin, 0.3cm from the \u000asuperior margin, 0.9cm from the medial margin, 1.0cm from the inferior \u000amargin, and 3.0cm from the posterior margin. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Perpendicular sections through the anterior margin, 3 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Perpendicular sections through the anterior margin, 4 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Serial sections from anterior to posterior, 1 frag in each, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Serial sections from anterior to posterior, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Serial sectioning from anterior to posterior, bisected with \u000asuperior in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and inferior in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , 1 frag in each, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Serial sectioning anterior to posterior slice is bisected with \u000asuperior in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and inferior in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , 1 frag in each, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Anterior to posterior, bisected with superior in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and \u000ainferior in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , 1 frag in each, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Perpendicular sections through posterior margin, 3 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Perpendicular sections through posterior margin, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Perpendicular sections through posterior margin, 3 frags, ESS. \u000aNote: Clip and biopsy cavity located in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000aERV/lp \u000aCASE NUMBER:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Xiaohua Qian M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on \u000aThursday REMOVED_MONTH 21,  REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 01:58:44PM \u000a[report_end] 
