D_DATE x 1.0cm  This is serially sectioned and \u000asubmitted in toto for microscopic examination. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  7 frags, ESS. \u000amab \u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: SURGICAL MARGIN \u000a[report_end] 
