ON_ID " through " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", \u000acorresponding to a right breast needle localized biopsy (7.5 x REMOVED_DATE x 2.1cm  \u000athe specimen was entirely submitted) performed on REMOVED_DATE  according to the \u000aaccompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name. \u000aIncluded is a consultation report from Tufts-New England Medical Center, \u000aBoston, MA; numbered " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " and dated REMOVED_DATE  referring to the case listed \u000aabove, bearing the patient's name. \u000aAlso included is a consultation report from Massachusetts General Hospital, \u000aBoston, MA; numbered " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " and dated REMOVED_DATE  referring to the case \u000alisted above, bearing the patient's name. \u000aIncluded is a letter from Dr. Frederick Koerner at Massachusetts General \u000aHospital, Boston, MA; to Dr. Ludmila Epshteyn at South Shore Hospital, South \u000aWeymouth, MA; referring to the case listed above and bearing the patient's \u000aname. \u000aReports to: CHEN, WENDY, YVONNE M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: OUTSIDE SLIDE CONSULT - BREAST \u000a[report_end] 
