efore inked in \u000ablue and the lateral half of the specimen is inked in black for the evaluation \u000aof margins. The specimen demonstrates some vague fibrous nodularity but there \u000aare no areas grossly suspicious for invasive carcinoma. The specimen is \u000aentirely submitted. \u000aMICRO #1-7: Central area of specimen (where two localizing wires were located), \u000amult frags, ESS. \u000aMICRO #8-10: Portion of specimen lateral to central region of breast, mult \u000afrags, ESS. \u000aMICRO #11-13: Portion of specimen medial to central region of breast, mult \u000afrags, ESS. \u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
