 two, labeled "#2, right breast (870 grams), short stitch superior, long \u000astitch lateral", is a right breast simple mastectomy (870 grams, REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x \u000a4.0cm ) with attached skin ellipse (20.0 x 10.0cm ), nipple areola (3.5 x REMOVED_DATE \u000acm) and skin scar (5.0cm ) in the center of the quadrant. Cross sectioning \u000areveals a biopsy cavity (2.3 x REMOVED_DATE x 1.5cm ) located in the mid-outer quadrant. \u000aAdjacent to this biopsy cavity is diffuse area of fibrosis (3.5 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE \u000acm). The biopsy cavity is greater than 3.0cm from the deep soft tissue \u000amargin. The breast parenchyma surrounding the biopsy cavity was entirely \u000asubmitted. Breast is greater than 85% yellow adipose tissue. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast parenchyma adjacent to biopsy cavity, 6 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast parenchya with biopsy cavity, located in the upper \u000aand lower outer quadrants, 5 frags, RSS. \u000aMicro 22: area of fibrosis in the upper inner quadrant, 1 frag, RSS. \u000aMicro 23: area of fibrosis in the lower inner quadrant, 1 frag, RSS. \u000aMicro 29: skin and nipple/areola, 3 frags, RSS. \u000aqqd \u000aReports to: MATORY, YVEDT M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST MASTECTOMY - PARTIAL OR SIMPLE \u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST MASTECTOMY - PARTIAL OR SIMPLE \u000a[report_end] 
