OVED_DATE  sections adjacent to nodule, 2 frag, RSS \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  additional sections remote from nodule on each side, 2 frag, RSS \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  remainder of specimen, mult frags, ESS. \u000ajmh \u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
