imen is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE \u000acm tan/white cystic mass containing purulent white cloudy material extending \u000ato within 0.5cm of the posterior, 0.9cm of the inferior, 1.5cm to the \u000asuperior, 0.1cm of the anterior, 0.9cm of the medial, and 1.4cm to the \u000alateral resection margin. In addition there is a 0.8cm simple cyst extending \u000ato within 0.3cm of the anterior, 1.0cm from the inferior, 1.9cm from the \u000asuperior, 1.8cm from the lateral, and 2.4cm of the medial resection margin. \u000aNo other gross masses or lesions are present. The greatest dimensions of the \u000aspecimen are medial to lateral, followed by superior to inferior; the specimen \u000ais submitted in its entirety in serial sections from the medial to lateral. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  medial edge, mult frags, ESS \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  specimen in serial sections from medial to lateral, cyst in 4 \u000athrough 6, 8, and 9, mult frags, ESS \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  lateral edge, mult frags, ESS \u000amcc \u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
