 are noted. The specimen is entirely submitted. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast tissue containing wire, 1 frag each, RSS \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast tissue close to the wire, 1 frag ech, RSS \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  remainder of breast tissue, REMOVED_DATE frags each, ESS \u000akms \u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
