eral margin, perpendicular, 3 frags, RSS. \u000aMicro 9: Posterior margin, perpendicular, 1 frag, RSS. \u000aMicro 10: Skin with scar, 1 frag, RSS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Superior margin, 3 frags, 3 cassettes, RSS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Superior/posterior margin, 3 frags, 2 cassettes, RSS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Posterior/inferior margin, 2 frags, 2 cassettes, RSS. \u000aMicro 18: Inferior margin, 1 frag, RSS. \u000aMicro 19: Inferior margin, 1 frag, RSS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Lateral margin, 4 frags, 2 cassettes, RSS. \u000aMicro 22: Posterior margin, 1 frag, RSS. \u000aMicro 23: Lateral margin, 2 frags, RSS. \u000aReports to: MATORY, YVEDT M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST MASTECTOMY - PARTIAL OR SIMPLE \u000a[report_end] 
