D_DATE x 0.5cm white/gray, fairly \u000awell-circumscribed firm nodule less than 0.1cm from the orange ink. The \u000anodule is 1.4cm from the stitch present at the duct margin. The adjacent \u000aparenchyma is yellow/gray with focal gelatinous areas. The specimen is \u000aentirely submitted. \u000aMicro 1: duct margin in proximity to the stitch, 1 frag, ESS \u000aMicro 2: remaining portion of duct, 3 frags, ESS \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  nodule described, 2 frags, ESS \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  remaining portion of specimen, mult frags, ESS \u000acmg \u000aReports to: KAELIN, CAROLYN, MARY M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST MASTECTOMY - PARTIAL OR SIMPLE \u000a[report_end] 
