S. \u000aMicro 6: slice of breast mass, bisected, 2 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro 7: fragment of breast mass, 1 frag, ESS. \u000ako \u000aReports to: CHRISTIAN, ROGER, L. M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
