gin. The specimen has been previously inked by the \u000asurgeon with the following orientation: Superior = red, lateral = green, \u000ainferior = yellow, medial = orange, anterior = blue, and posterior = black. \u000aThe specimen is entirely submitted for histologic analysis. \u000aMicro 1: perpendicular superior margin, 2 frags, ESS \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  remainder of breast biopsy, 2 frags each, ESS \u000abhl \u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
