ue; superior = red; inferior = green; lateral = yellow; medial = \u000aorange. Serial sectioning demonstrates an area of white firm fibrous tissue \u000a(approximately REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.6cm ), located at the superior margin, 0.2cm \u000afrom the medial margin, 1.5cm from the lateral margin, 0.6cm from the \u000ainferior margin, 0.8cm from the anterior margin, and 1.1cm from the \u000aposterior margin. The specimen is entirely submitted from anterior to \u000aposterior. \u000aMicro 1: anterior margin, perpendicular, 4 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  serial sections including fibrous area in sections 3 and 4, \u000a6 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro 8: posterior margin, perpendicular, 7 frags, ESS. \u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
