brous tissue. Adjacent \u000ato the area, there is a small focus of hemorrhage. This area is 0.3cm from \u000athe inferior margin, 0.8cm from the superior margin, 1.4cm from the \u000aposterior margin and 1.0cm from the anterior margin. The lateral margin is 2 \u000acm away and the medial margin is 1.8cm away. Representative sections are \u000asubmitted for histologic evaluation. The specimen is 50% fibrous tissue and \u000a50% fat. \u000aMicro 1: lateral margin, 4 frags, RSS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  area closest to clip, 14 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  additional areas of the specimen, 12 frags, RSS. \u000aMicro 17: lateral margin, 3 frags, RSS. \u000amir \u000aReports to: SHOJI, BRENT, T. M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
