perior to inferior. On cut section 80% of the tissue \u000ais comprised of firm, tan/white fibrosis which is concentrated in the \u000ainferior/lateral portion of the specimen that appears to involve all inked \u000amargins. There are cystic areas ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 0.3cm  The specimen is \u000asubmitted in toto for microscopic examination. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  right breast mass, 12 frags, ESS. \u000aeab \u000aReports to: MATORY, YVEDT M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
