imen) and \u000asectioned. Representative sections are submitted, to include majority of \u000asubcutaneous nodular area. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Nodule, 3 frags, RSS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Additional skin, multi frags, RSS. \u000adb\u005cpab \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Michael W Bennett M.B., B.C.H., Electronically signed on \u000a1/9/ REMOVED_CASE_ID  \u000a[report_end] 
