ocks submitted is designated on this specimen radiograph. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  breast tissue, clips in 3 and 8, 12 frags, RSS \u000aeab \u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
