ior \u000amargin, at the anterior margin, at the medial margin, and at the lateral \u000amargin. There is scant remaining uninvolved tissue composed of yellow/tan \u000agrossly unremarkable adipose tissue. The specimen is entirely submitted. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  Serial sections through specimen, REMOVED_DATE frags in each, ESS. \u000ajdr \u000aReports to: MATORY, YVEDT, L. M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
