ht breast", consists of a single brown unmarked cassette \u000aconsisting of multiple, soft, fragmented, yellow to white tissue cores (1.3 x \u000a1.0 x 0.2cm in aggregate). \u000aMicro 1: Multi frags, ESS. \u000adfi \u000aReports to: TORRES-BERASTAIN, IDELISA M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES) \u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST CORE NEEDLE BIOPSY(IES) \u000a[report_end] 
