E  fragment #1, 9 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  fragment #2, 8 frag, ESS. \u000ajoc \u000aReports to: BERTAGNOLLI, MONICA, MARIE M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST BIOPSY W/O MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
