mately 60% adipose. The entire \u000aspecimen is submitted for microscopic examination. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  firm area and inferior margin, 1 frag each, ESS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  medial margin, 2 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  lateral margin, 2 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  anterior margin, 2 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  posterior margin, 2 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  remainder of breast tissue, multi frags, ESS. \u000akms \u000aReports to: CARTER, KATHARINE M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
