ate), which are submitted in toto. The second green cassette, labeled \u000a"B", contains multiple irregular tan/pink to yellow fibrofatty tissues (2.5 x \u000a2.5 x 0.4cm in aggregate), which are submitted in toto. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Tissues in cassette, labeled "A/Calcification", 2 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Tissues in cassette, labeled "B", multi frags, ESS. \u000almc/lp \u000aCASE NUMBER:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Jane E. Brock M.B., B.S., Ph.D., Electronically signed on \u000aWednesday REMOVED_MONTH 25,  REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 01:04:28PM \u000a[report_end] 
