ns are not \u000aevaluable. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  6-4-2-3-3 frags, ESS. \u000aPart five, labeled "#5. Breast tissue medial to all previous specimens", \u000aconsists of two fragments of fibrofatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm \u000a(inked blue) and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.5cm (inked green). Due to the fragmented \u000anature of this specimen, true margins are not evaluable. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  4 frags each, ESS. \u000aviv \u000aReports to: KANE, GREGORY, J. M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000aADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
