SION_ID   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " and " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", corresponding to a right breast core biopsy (3.0 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE \u000acm) performed on REMOVED_DATE  according to the accompanying pathology report \u000abearing the patient's name. \u000aForty-three (43) slides are labeled " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " and sublabeled " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " through \u000a" REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", corresponding to a right breast needle localized excision (5.5 x REMOVED_DATE x \u000a3.6cm ) performed on REMOVED_DATE  according to the accompanying pathology report \u000abearing the patient's name. \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Deborah A Dillon M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end] 
