s. The specimen is radiographed and \u000aa clip is identified. The entire specimen is submitted serially from lateral \u000ato medial. \u000aMicro 1&2: lateral margin perpendicular, multi frags, ESS. \u000aMicro 3: slice lateral to clip, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro 4: slice with clip, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro REMOVED_DATE  serial slices medial to clip, multi frags, ESS. \u000aMicro 10: medial margin, perpendicular, 4 frags, ESS. \u000ahph \u000aReports to: RHEI, ESTHER M.D. \u000aSPECIMEN TYPE: BREAST - EXCISIONAL TISSUE W/MARGINS \u000a[report_end] 
