ult slides. \u000aGROSS DESCRIPTION: \u000aReceived from Sturdy Memorial Hospital, Pathology Department, 211 Park Street, \u000aP.O. Box  REMOVED_CASE_ID , Attleboro, MA REMOVED_DATE  are twenty-six (26) glass slides. \u000aThe slides are labeled " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " and sublabeled "AFS", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", "1", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  ER \u000aw/CONT", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  ER NEG CONT", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  PR w/CONT", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  PR NEG CONT", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  Neg CONT \u000aACTN", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  ACTIN POS CONTROL", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", "2", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " through " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " and " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " through \u000a" REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", corresponding to A) left breast excision for a mass (three segments: REMOVED_DATE \u000ax REMOVED_DATE x 1.2cm REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1.3cm  and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.7cm ) B) left breast, \u000aadditional margin, excision (3.3 x REMOVED_DATE x 0.8cm ) performed on REMOVED_DATE  \u000aaccording to the accompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name. \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aResident Review by Deborah A Dillon M.D., on REMOVED_DATE \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Deborah A Dillon M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end] 
