ecimen is inked per \u000apathology protocol for the evaluation of margins: posterior/black; \u000aanterior/blue; superior/red; inferior/green; lateral/yellow; medial/orange. A \u000alocalization wire enters the specimen at the superior aspect and transfers it \u000ato exit at the posterior/inferior aspect. The specimen is accompanied by a \u000aradiograph confirming the presence of surgical clips and a mass with an intact \u000awire within the specimen. The specimen is serially sectioned from inferior to \u000asuperior into ten sections. Slice #1 designated inferior aspect and slice #10 \u000athe superior aspect. The clip is recovered in slice #6. Sectioning reveals a \u000a0.7 x REMOVED_DATE x approximately 0.9cm tan/gray firm mass most prominent in sections \u000a5, 6, and 7. This mass comes to within 0.1cm of the deep margin, 0.3cm of \u000athe medial margin, 0.6cm of the anterior margin, 1.5cm of the lateral margin, \u000aapproximately 1.7cm of the superior margin, and approximately 2.0cm of the \u000ainferior margin. The specimen is entirely submitted for histologic review. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #1, 4 frags, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #2, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #3, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #4, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #5, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #6, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #7, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #8, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #9, 1 frag, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #10, 6 frags, ESS. \u000aMDH/lp \u000aCASE NUMBER:  REMOVED_CASE_ID . \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Vania Nose MD, PhD, Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end] 
