 per block, ESS. \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Entirely submitted specimen submitted medial to lateral, 1 frag \u000aper block, ESS. Note, the clip is associated with tissue in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , and \u000athe wire is between tissue submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . \u000aMicro  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Lateral margin, 2, 3 frags, ESS. \u000aTA/mmm \u000aCASE NUMBER:  REMOVED_CASE_ID  \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Jason L Hornick M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on \u000aFriday REMOVED_MONTH 19,  REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 03:43:41PM \u000a[report_end] 
