 slides are labeled " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " and sublabeled " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " through " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", \u000a" REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ",  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " and " REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ", corresponding to a left breast wire \u000aneedle localized excision (3.2 x REMOVED_DATE x 0.8cm ) performed on REMOVED_DATE  according \u000ato the accompanying pathology report bearing the patient's name. \u000aIncluded is an office consultation report from the Breast Care Center at South \u000aShore Hospital dated REMOVED_DATE  bearing the patient's name. \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Deborah A Dillon M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE \u000a[report_end] 
