he patient's \u000aname. \u000aIncluded is a pathology report from the same institution numbered "S- REMOVED_CASE_ID -00" \u000aand dated REMOVED_DATE  referring to a left breast re-excision (4.0 x REMOVED_DATE x 2.5cm ), \u000abearing the patient's name. \u000aAlso included is a cytology report from the same hospital numbered "S- REMOVED_CASE_ID -06" \u000aand dated REMOVED_DATE  referring to a left breast, 2 o'clock, fine needle \u000aaspiration, bearing the patient's name (outside diagnosis: "suspicious for \u000amalignancy"). \u000aIncluded also are two (2) lab reports from the same institution; one report is \u000anumbered " REMOVED_CASE_ID : REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " and dated REMOVED_DATE  referring to immunohistochemistry \u000astudies performed on block "A" from the case listed above "S- REMOVED_CASE_ID S-99"; the \u000asecond report is numbered " REMOVED_CASE_ID : REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID " and dated REMOVED_DATE  referring to \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID /neu by FISH analysis performed on block "B from the case listed above \u000a"S- REMOVED_CASE_ID -06" (NOT AMPLIFIED), bearing the patient's name. \u000aBy his/her signature below, the senior physician certifies that he/she \u000apersonally conducted a microscopic examination ("gross only" exam if so stated) \u000aof the described specimen(s) and rendered or confirmed the diagnosis(es) \u000arelated thereto. \u000aFinal Diagnosis by Susan Lester M.D., Ph.D., Electronically signed on \u000a5/15/ REMOVED_CASE_ID  \u000a[report_end] 
