ing the needle in I through K, representative sections of the remaining tissue in L through Q. Resident: Jo-Ann E. Haney, MD *** INTRA-OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS *** FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS GROSS #1-2(SUPERIOR SUPERFICIAL AND ADDITIONAL SUPERFICIAL LEFT BREAST BX): ADIPOSE TISSUE NO DIAGNOSTIC ABNORMALITY RECOGNIZED. THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF INVASIVE CARCINOMA. FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS GROSS #3 (LEFT BREAST MEDIAL/INFERIOR): THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF INVASIVE CARCINOMA. O.R. Resident: Elizabeth Bailey, MD O.R. Diagnosis by: Nancy Lee Harris, M.D. =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SURGICAL DAY CARE - ACC 3 REPORTS TO: Barbara Smith, M.D. PART : LEFT BREAST, BIOPSY \u000a[report_end] 
