ging in size from REMOVED_DATE to 2cm  are encountered. Representative sections are submitted as follows: A: Cavity and closest deep resection margin. B-D: Biopsy cavity. E-F: Parenchyma away from biopsy cavity. G: White-gray rubbery nodule H: 1 bisected lymph node. I: 3 lymph node candidates. J: 3 lymph nodes. K: 3 lymph nodes. L: 1 lymph node. Resident: CHRISTINE GARCIA, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: MGH-OUTPATIENT (OFF.P/CLINIC) REPORTS TO: Kevin S. Hughes, M.D. PART : BREAST(LEFT),MODIFIED RADICAL MASTECTOMY 
