al Diagnosis certifies that he/she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses. ADDENDUM NOTE: REASON: 2 RESULTS OF FLUORESCENCE IN SITU HYBRIDIZATION (FISH) FOR HER-2/NEU GENE AMPLIFICATION Breast (Right, block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ): HER-2/neu gene in tumor cells: REMOVED_DATE (Not Amplified). See note. Note: Results are expressed as the average ratio of HER-2 signals (112) to chromosome 17 signals (102) in 60 tumor cell nuclei. A ratio of greater than REMOVED_DATE or equal to REMOVED_DATE indicates  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID /neu gene amplification adjusted for chromosome 17 polysomy using PathVysion by Vysis. Results at or near the cutoff point (ranging from REMOVED_DATE - 2.2) should be interpreted with caution. Addendum #2 by Atul K Bhan M.D., Electronically signed on Thursday REMOVED_MONTH 18,  REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 05:45:22PM By his/her signature above, the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he/she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses. PART A: Breast (Right), Excision PART B: Lymph Nodes (Right Axilla), Dissection PART C: Breast (Right, Final Medial Margin), Excision PART D: Breast (Right, Final Superior Margin), Excision PART E: Breast (Right, Final Lateral Margin), Excision PART F: Breast (Right, Final Inferior Margin), Excision PART G: B [report_end] 
