es. GROSS DESCRIPTION: Unfixed, labeled "Mikki Ansin, REMOVED_DATE  right breast", is a 490 gram aggregate of yellow lobulated hemorrhagic breast tissue partially surfaced by pieces of unremarkable skin from 4 to 9cm in greatest dimension and a separate 12 x REMOVED_DATE x 0.1cm piece of unremarkable skin. The specimen consists of yellow lobulated adipose tissue with moderate white-pink firm focally cystic breast tissue. There is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.7cm glistening pink-white lymph node, which is submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Sections of breast tissue are submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Unfixed, labeled "Mikki Ansin, REMOVED_DATE  left breast", is a 450 gram aggregate of yellow hemorrhagic fatty breast tissue partially surfaced by pieces of unremarkable skin from 3.5cm to 7.5cm in greatest dimension and a separate 8 x 3 x 0.1cm piece of unremarkable skin. The specimen consists of yellow adipose tissue with sparse interweaving white-pink, focally cystic breast tissue. Three lymph nodes measure from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.8cm  Representative sections are submitted as follows:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Representative breast tissue, and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID .  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : 1 lymph node, trisected.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : 2 lymph nodes Final Diagnosis by Frederick Carl Koerner M.D., Electronically signed on Tuesday REMOVED_MONTH 18,  REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 04:44:26PM PART A: Breast (Right), Mammoplasty PART B: Breast (Left), Mammoplasty [report_end] 
