ogy Department at the Massachusetts General Hospital. They have not been cleared or approved by the U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA). The FDA has determined that such clearance or approval is not necessary; this laboratory has established and verified the test's accuracy and precision. Added by: Atul Kumar Bhan, M.D. Signed On: 15 REMOVED_MONTH 00 at 17:11 GROSS DESCRIPTION: Received fresh, labeled with the patient's name, unit number and "right breast excision" is a lumpectomy specimen measuring 5 x REMOVED_DATE x 2.2cm with a needle localization wire. The entire specimen is inked black, posterior margin overinked blue, superior margin overinked yellow and inferior margin overinked orange. The specimen is sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.7cm firm gritty white nodule present 0.2cm from the deep resection margin and 0.5cm from the inferior resection margin. Representative sections of the nodule and closest proximity to the resection margin is submitted in cassettes A-C. Grossly normal breast parenchyma away from nodule in cassette D. Received fresh, labeled with the patient's name, unit number and "sentinel lymph node" is one 1.7cm lymph node which is bisected and entirely submitted in cassette E. Received fresh, labeled with the patient's name, unit number and "additional deep margin inferior" are multiple fragments of fibroadipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1.2cm in aggregate. The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes F-H. Received fresh, labeled with the patient's name, unit number and "final shave margin" are multiple fragments of fibroadipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2.2cm in aggregate. The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes I-M. Resident: GUILLERMO J TEARNEY, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT -  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO: Bradford Marshall Smith, M.D. PART A: BREAST (RIGHT), EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B: LYMPH NODE (RIGHT "SENTINEL NODE"), EXCISION PART C: BREAST (RIGHT "ADDITIONAL DEEP MARGIN/INFERIOR"), PART D: BREAST (RIGHT "FINAL SHAVED MARGIN"), EXCISION 
