or", are multiple fragments of fibroadipose tissue that measure in aggregate REMOVED_DATE x 2 x 0.6cm  The specimen is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Labeled "left breast final margin deep", is a 3 x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue that is serially sectioned and entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A: Breast (Left), Excision PART B: Breast (Left, Final Margin, Lateral), Excision PART C: Breast (Left, Final Margin, Superior), Excision PART D: Breast (Left, Final Margin, Medial), Excision PART E: Breast (Left, Final Margin, Inferior), Excision PART F: Breast (Left, Final Margin, Deep), Excisio [report_end] 
