n the mid-portion of the specimen. The lesion is located 0.4cm from the anterior margin, 0.5cm from the posterior margin, 0.9cm from the superior margin, 1.5cm from the inferior margin and greater than 2.0cm from the medial margin. Approximately 60% of the remainder of the specimen consists of soft, white fibrous tissue with the remaining tissue being soft, lobulated, yellow adipose tissue. Representative sections are submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , from the lateral to the medial end with the lesion in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . The medial margin is submitted en face in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . The remainder of the specimen is entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  from the medial to the lateral aspect. Gross Dictation by Tim Robinson, on REMOVED_DATE Micro/Dx Dictation by Kristina Braaten M.D., on REMOVED_DATE Final Review by Kristina Braaten M.D., on REMOVED_DATE Micro/Dx Dictation by Kristina Braaten M.D., on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Kristina Braaten M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART : BREAST (RIGHT), EXCISION 
