ns are submitted sequentially from lateral to medial in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  as follows:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Lateral margin.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Uninvolved parenchyma adjacent to lateral margin.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Entire mass.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Medial margin taken en face. Received fresh, labeled with the patient's name, unit number, and "additional dense tissue", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.5cm unoriented tan-yellow to pink lobulated portion of fibrofatty tissue. The specimen is inked black, serially sectioned, to reveal an unremarkable tan-yellow to pink fibrofatty cut surface with no discrete masses or lesions identified. The specimen is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Gross Dictation by Jennifer Nash, on REMOVED_DATE Micro/Dx Dictation by Dennis Sgroi M.D., on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Dennis Sgroi M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A: BREAST (RIGHT), EXCISION PART B: BREAST (RIGHT ADDITIONAL), EXCISION 
