ame and unit number, and "additional superficial margin" are two unoriented irregular portions of fibrofatty tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.5cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm  Sectioning revealing that each piece consists mainly of adipose tissue. The specimen is entirely submitted as G-H. Received fresh, labeled with the patient's name and unit number, and "final shaved margin" are three unoriented irregular portions of fibrofatty tissue which measure REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.5cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.9cm  The smallest portion is firm and fibrotic. Two larger portions consist mainly of adipose tissue. The specimen is entirely submitted as: I: Smallest portion. J,K,L: Remainder of specimen. Gross Description by: TIM J. ROBINSON Resident: JOSHUA B. KISH, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT -  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO: Barbara Lynn Smith, M.D. PART A: BREAST(LEFT),EXCISION PART B: BREAST(LEFT, SUPERFICIAL MARGIN),EXCISION PART C: BREAST(LEFT, FINAL SHAVED MARGIN),EXCISION 
