n REMOVED_DATE Micro/Dx Dictation by John H Eichhorn M.D., on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Elena F Brachtel M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART : BREAST (RIGHT), EXCISION 
