, 12 o'clock" is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1.7cm excision specimen with a localization wire. The specimen is inked. It consists of tan-white fibrous tissue and scattered unremarkable adipose tissue. The specimen is entirely submitted sequentially in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Final Diagnosis by Frederick Carl Koerner M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A: BREAST (RIGHT, "9 O'CLOCK LESION"), EXCISION PART B: BREAST (RIGHT, "12 O'CLOCK LESION"), EXCISION [report_end] 
