 1.0cm from the posterior margin as well as 1.0cm from the lateral edge of the specimen and a separate REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm cystic lesion filled with soft, finely papillary material, tan to pink. This second lesion is 0.7cm from the above cavity, located 0.4cm from the nearest superior margin, 0.6cm from the nearest posterior margin, 2.0cm from the nearest inferior margin and 3.0cm from the nearest anterior margin. The lesion is laterally located, approximately 0.5cm from the nearest lateral edge. Section Code:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Medial tip en face.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Representative sections of the lumpectomy specimen from medial to lateral including the cavitary lesion submitted entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and the second smaller lesion entirely in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  (two sections). Final Diagnosis by John H Eichhorn M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART : BREAST (RIGHT), EXCISION [report_end] 
