ioned into thirteen sections, which are numbered from lateral to medial. A 0.2cm metal cylinder is identified along the inferior margin in section #8. The specimen is entirely submitted as follows: SECTION CODE:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Lateral margin, radially.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Cross sections from lateral to medial (this is multiple per cassette).  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Medial margin, radially. Received fresh, labeled "left breast excisional biopsy lateral with needle loc (long lateral, short superior)", is a REMOVED_DATE (M-L) x REMOVED_DATE (S-I) x REMOVED_DATE (A-P)cm breast excisional biopsy specimen oriented with a long stitch left lateral and a short stitch superior. A needle localization wire is seen passing into the superior portion of the lateral aspect of the specimen, through the middle portion of the specimen and exiting in the inferior and posterior portion of the medial aspect. The specimen surface is notable for the presence of a REMOVED_DATE x 0.7cm area of brownish discoloration on the superior-posterior surface, possibly consistent with hemorrhage. The specimen is correlated with a specimen radiograph, which shows the presence of a radio-opaque cylindrical object within mid portion of the specimen. The specimen is inked per protocol: anterior - blue, posterior - black, superior - green, inferior - yellow. The specimen is serially sectioned into nine sections numbered REMOVED_DATE from lateral to medial. A red-brown hemorrhagic area measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.3cm is found abutting the superior and posterior margins and at the mid point between the medial and lateral margins. A 0.2cm metal cylinder is identified within this hemorrhagic area. The specimen is entirely submitted as follows: SECTION CODE:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Lateral margin, radially.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Serial cross sections from lateral to medial; sections containing hemorrhagic area and clip in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID .  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Medial margin, radially. Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A: BREAST (LEFT MEDIAL), EXCISION PART B: BREAST (LEFT LATERAL), EXCISION [report_end] 
