 both inferior and anterior resection margins, and 1.6cm from the lateral resection margins. The remaining specimen is sectioned to reveal unremarkable white-pink rubbery fibrous and tan-yellow fatty tissue with focal areas of hemorrhage noted around the area designated by the clip. No other additional lesions are identified. Representative sections are submitted as follows:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Sections around the area designated by the clip, submitted medial to laterally with  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  containing the full section containing the clip and cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ,  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  containing the nodule entirely.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Medial section away from parenchyma designated by clip.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Lateral parenchyma away from area designated by clip. Gross Dictation by Wei-Lien Wang M.D., on REMOVED_DATE Micro/Dx Dictation by Wei-Lien Wang M.D., on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Kristina Braaten M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART : BREAST (LEFT), EXCISION 
