itted in cassette G. The two smaller fragments are serially sectioned to reveal unremarkable parenchyma and skin with representative sections from the two submitted in cassette H. Resident: PAULA ARNELL, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT -  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO: Susan E Briggs, M.D. PART : BREAST (LEFT), RE-EXCISION 
