r, containing tan to white caseating material. Representative sections from the largest mass is submitted in cassette A to D. Representative section of the dense fibrous tissue directly deep from the nipple are submitted in cassettes E and H-K. A section of the dense mass on the lateral anterior resection margin is submitted in cassettes F. A section containing white fibrous tissue at the medial anterior/inferior margin is submitted in cassette G. Several lymph nodes from the lateral end of the specimen, REMOVED_DATE to 1.0cm  are submitted in cassettes L-N. Resident: HOWARD CHANG, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: MGH-INPATIENT (FLR.UNKNOWN) REPORTS TO: Barbara Lynn Smith, M.D. Michael J Yaremchuk, M.D. PART : LEFT MASTECTOMY \u000a[report_end] 
