inantly dense white fibrous tissue interspersed with a minute amount of the adipose tissue. Specimen is submitted in its entirety in cassettes K and L. Gross Description by: JANINE L. DUDAC Resident: HENRY DONG, MD *** INTRA-OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS *** GROSS DIAGNOSIS, BREAST (LEFT), BIOPSY: HEMORRHAGIC CYST. NO LESIONS GROSSLY SUSPICOUS FOR INFILTRATING CARCINOMA ARE IDENTIFIED. O.R. Resident: STAMATINA KAPTAIN, MD O.R. Diagnosis by: G. Richard Dickersin, M.D. =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT -  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO: Michele Annette Gadd, M.D. PART A: BREAST MASS (LEFT), BIOPSY PART B: BREAST (LEFT), BIOPSY \u000a[report_end] 
