n by Heather Burton, on REMOVED_DATE Micro/Dx Dictation by Melinda J Lerwill M.D., on REMOVED_DATE Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A: BREAST (RIGHT), SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART B: BREAST (LEFT), SIMPLE MASTECTOMY PART C: LYMPH NODES (LEFT AXILLA), EXCISION 
