rgin. The specimen is entirely inked black, overinked yellow on the edge with suture. Sections are submitted entirely in cassette I-M. Received fresh, labeled with the patient's name and unit number, and "new medial margin B", is a fragment of breast tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.8cm  with a silk suture indicating the new medial margin. The specimen is entirely inked black, overinked yellow at the edge indicated by the suture, and entirely submitted in cassette N-P. Resident: LAURENCE DE LEVAL, MD =============================================================================== SOURCE CARE UNIT: SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT -  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO: Rosa Sung Eun Choi, M.D. PART A: BREAST (RIGHT), EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B: BREAST (RIGHT, "NEW LATERAL MARGIN"), EXCISIONAL B PART C: BREAST(RIGHT, "NEW MEDIAL MARGIN") EXCISIONAL BIOP \u000a[report_end] 
