e/she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses. PART A: Lymph Node (Right Axilla, "Sentinel" # REMOVED_CASE_ID ), Excision PART B: Breast (Right), Simple Mastectomy PART C: Breast (Left), Simple Mastectomy PART D: Lymph Node (Left Axilla, "Sentinel" # REMOVED_CASE_ID ), Excision PART E: Right Mastectomy Flap, Excision PART F: Left Mastectomy Flap, Excision [report_end] 
