to 15 slices numbered from medial to lateral. On cut section the specimen is primarily fibrous, with some focal areas of adipose tissue. There is a slightly firm and granular region in slices #3-6 along the inferior and posterior margins. There is a fibrous area with brownish discoloration and hemorrhage consistent with biopsy site in slices #9-13 and containing a metal clip in slice #11. The fibrous area abuts the posterior margin through these sections, and a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.8cm  partially disrupted tan-white, moderately well-circumscribed mass lesion is present in slices #12-13 and abuts the posterior margin. Representative sections to include the areas denoted by the localization wires are submitted as follows: SECTION CODE:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #1 (medial margin), radially, entirely.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #2, entirely.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #3, entirely.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #4, entirely.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #5, entirely.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #6, inferior portion.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #9, superior portion.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #9, inferior portion.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #10 (incomplete margin).  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #11, all but superior portion, with clip site.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #12, inferior-posterior portion.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #12, mass lesion, radial to posterior margin.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #13, mass lesion.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Additional portion of slice #13.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Slice #15 (lateral margin), radially, entirely.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Remainder of mass lesion. Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M.D., Electronically signed on Thursday REMOVED_MONTH 15,  REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 06:17:30PM By his/her signature above, the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he/she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses. PART : Breast (Right), Excision [report_end] 
