lity. Specimen is entirely submitted from medial to lateral as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , with the medial end margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , and the lateral end margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Received fresh, labeled Darli Dasilva, #352-57-33 and "right breast medial margin", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.7cm aggregate of gray-white to tan-red fibrofatty tissue with no orientation. Sectioning reveals diffuse dense gray-white fibrous tissue with no discrete lesion or other gross abnormality. The specimen is entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A: Breast (Right), Excision PART B: Breast (Right, Medial Margin), Excision [report_end] 
