east tissue that is threaded through the localization needle and is detached from but abuts the inferior aspect of the main specimen. This detached tissue is inked black. The specimen is submitted entirely from superior to inferior as follows:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Superior margin, en face.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Parenchyma with anterior, posterior, medial and lateral margins (with area denoted by needle localization wire in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ).  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Inferior margin, en face.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Detached piece of breast tissue, entirely submitted. Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART : Breast (Right), Excision [report_end] 
