Y), EXCISION: THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY IN 2 LYMPH NODES. FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS #2; LYMPH NODE (SENTINEL, LEFT AXILLARY), EXCISION: THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY. FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS #3; LYMPH NODE (LEFT AXILLARY SENTINEL NODES), EXCISION: THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY. Final Diagnosis by Melinda J Lerwill M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART : LYMPH NODE (RIGHT AXILLA, "SENTINEL" COUNT 543 \u005cT\u005c 468), EXC 
