SION_ID : Outer upper quadrant.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Outer lower quadrant.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Central breast parenchyma.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Upper inner quadrant.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Inner lower quadrant.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Additional tissue. In fixative, labeled "Aimee Mury, REMOVED_DATE  subareolar margin, right breast", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm piece of unremarkable white to tan-yellow fibrofatty tissue, which is entirely submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . In fixative, labeled "Aimee Mury, REMOVED_DATE  additional subareolar tissue, right breast", are two pieces of unremarkable gray-white to tan-pink fibrofatty tissue REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.3cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.6cm  which are entirely submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . In fixative, labeled "Aimee Mury, REMOVED_DATE  subareolar margin, left breast", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.2cm piece of unremarkable gray-white tissue, which is entirely submitted in cassette  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . In fixative, labeled "Aimee Mury, REMOVED_DATE  additional superficial margin, left breast", are three pieces of unremarkable tan-pink to yellow soft tissue fragments from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm  which are entirely submitted in cassettes  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  INTRA-OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS: FROZEN SECTION #1 & FX#1A; LYMPH NODE, RIGHT AXILLA: THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY. FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS #2; SENTINEL LYMPH NODE, LEFT AXILLA: THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY. Final Diagnosis by Frederick Carl Koerner M.D., Electronically signed on Thursday REMOVED_MONTH 12,  REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 01:15:40PM By his/her signature above, the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he/she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses. PART A: Lymph Nodes (Right Axilla, "Sentinel"), Excision PART B: Lymph Nodes (Left Axi