posterior is inked black, and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal fibrous parenchyma with some small (0.1-0.2cm ) cysts. No tumor masses are identified. The metal clips are identified at the 6 o'clock of the specimen in the middle to outer quadrant. Candidate lymph nodes are identified ranging from REMOVED_DATE to 1.2cm  SECTION CODE:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Representative section, upper inner quadrant.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Representative section, lower inner quadrant.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Upper outer quadrant.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Middle of the specimen.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Inferior to outer pole where the clips were found.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Lower outer quadrant.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Candidate lymph nodes, each cassette with 1 bisected lymph node and 1 full lymph node inked blue.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Additional sections from lower outer quadrant. Received fresh, labeled "left breast, stitch at 6 p.m.", is a 21 x 18 x 5.5cm simple mastectomy specimen with a stitch designating the 6 p.m. - inferior margin and with a 5 x 3cm nipple areola complex, grossly unremarkable. The anterior surface is inked blue, the posterior - black and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal fibrous tissue with some small cysts. An ill-defined mass is not identified. Two candidate lymph nodes are identified. SECTION CODE:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Superior outer quadrant.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Inferior outer quadrant.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Middle quadrant.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Superior inner quadrant.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Inferior outer quadrant.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : 1 candidate lymph node bisected.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : 1 candidate lymph node in its entirety. Received in formalin are 2 additional containers which are labeled Maude Rich, #438-01-73. Labeled "left mastectomy skin", is a 17cm long x 0.4cm wide strip of pink unremarkable skin, excised to a depth of 0.15cm  Representative sections are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Labeled "right mastectomy skin", are multiple fragments of skin strips, measuring in aggregate 5 x REMOVED_DATE x 0.15cm  2 representative sections are submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Final Diagnosis by Ritu Ghai M.D., Electronically signed on Wednesday REMOVED_MONTH 06,  REMOVED_CASE_ID  at 12:28:41PM By his/her signature above, the pathologist listed as making the Final Diagnosis certifies that he/she has personally reviewed this case and confirmed or corrected the diagnoses. PART A: Breast (Right), Simple Mastectomy PART B: Breast (Left), Simple Mastectomy PART C: Skin (Left Mastectomy), Excision PART D: Skin (Right Mastectomy), Excision [report_end] 
