n size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.3cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.3cm  The entire specimen is submitted as follows: SECTION CODE:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Smallest fragment, serially sectioned.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Fragment, serially sectioned.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Largest fragment, serially sectioned. Received in formalin, labeled with "right breast, final margin, lateral half of cavity", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.5cm aggregate of tan-yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue, submitted in toto as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Received in formalin, labeled with "re-excision, left breast", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1.0cm oriented portion of tan-yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue with a short stitch designating superior, a long stitch designating lateral margin. The specimen is inked as follows: Anterior blue, posterior black, superior green, inferior yellow. The specimen is serially sectioned along the medial to lateral axis to reveal a diffuse tan-white fibrous cut surface interspersed with tan-yellow lobulated adipose tissue. No discrete mass or lesion is noted. The entire specimen is sequentially submitted from medial to lateral axis, as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , en face section medial margin as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , en face section, lateral margin as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Received in formalin, labeled with "left breast final margin, superior half of cavity", are four unoriented fragments of tan-yellow lobulated fibroadipose tissue ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.3cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.5cm  The entire specimen is submitted as follows: SECTION CODE:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Three smaller fragments, submitted in toto.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Largest fragment, serially sectioned. Received in formalin, labeled with "left breast final margin, inferior half of cavity", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.5cm portion of tan-yellow lobulated, focally fragmented fibroadipose tissue, serially sectioned