 the inferior margin, and >2.0cm of the medial and lateral margins. Within the cavity is a silver metal clip. Representative sections are submitted from medial to lateral as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , with the medial end margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and the lateral end margin en face as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , the tissue containing the silver metal clip as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , and the cavity as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART : BREAST (LEFT), EXCISION [report_end] 
