tted as follows: SECTION CODE:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Medial margin, en face.  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Body of specimen, submitted sequentially from medial to lateral, with the section containing the metallic clip in block  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID : Lateral margin, en face. Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART : BREAST (LEFT), EXCISION [report_end] 
