E x 0.7cm cavity abutting the anterior margin, 0.5cm from the posterior margin, 0.5cm from the inferior margin, 0.6cm from the superior margin, 0.9cm from the lateral margin, and 1.2cm from the medial margin. Representative sections are submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  with the medial end en face in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  and the lateral end en face in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Received in formalin, labeled "right breast final medial margin", is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm partially fragmented yellow fibrofatty tissue without orienting suture. The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal lobulated yellow adipose tissue with white fibrous tissue and is entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Received in formalin, labeled "right breast superior margin final", are 3 lobulated yellow fibrofatty tissues ranging from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm without orienting sutures. The tissues are serially sectioned to reveal sparse yellow adipose tissue with white-pink firm fibrous tissue and are entirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Received in formalin, labeled "right breast lateral margin", are 2 yellow fibrofatty soft tissues measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.3cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm without orienting suture. The tissues are serially sectioned to reveal white firm fibrous tissue and sparse yellow adipose tissue and are entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Received in formalin, labeled "right breast inferior margin", are 2 yellow lobulated fibrofatty tissues measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.3cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0.4cm without orienting sutures. The tissues are serially sectioned to reveal white firm fibrous tissue with spares yellow adipose tissue and are entirely submitted as  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . Final Diagnosis by Ronald Balassanian M.D., Electronically signed on REMOVED_DATE PART A: Breast (Right),Re- Excision PART B: Breast (Right, Final Medial Margin), Excision PART C: Breast (Right, Final Superior Margin), Excision PART D: Breast (Right, Final Lateral Margin), Excision PART E: Breast (Right, Final Inferior Margin), Excision [report_end] 
