he margins of this piece \u000athroughout are inked black. The deep surface is double-inked red and the \u000asuperior surface is inked blue. It is cross sectioned and serially submitted \u000afrom the long suture towards the short suture revealing a central area of \u000arubbery, white-tan fibrous tissue surrounding an area of fat necrosis. It is \u000aentirely submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . The separate portion is inked black throughout \u000aand is cross sectioned and serially submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . 14 agg. all. \u000aSpecimen B labeled "additional breast tissue" consists of a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2.5cm  \u000aportion of fibroadipose tissue. The outer surfaces are inked black throughout. \u000aIt is serially sectioned revealing areas of rubbery white-tan fibrous tissue \u000aand is serially submitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . 12 agg. all. \u000aDictated by: DDK____(signature on file)____MICHAEL J. ROSS, M.D. REMOVED_DATE (Final) \u000a____(signature on file)____DANIEL D. KOELLIKER, M.D. REMOVED_DATE (Final) \u000a[report_end] 
