and measures 18 x REMOVED_DATE x 1.5cm  The \u000aattached nipple and areola complex measures 2.7cm  in diameter. The nipple \u000ameasures 1.5cm  in diameter. Both are grossly unremarkable. The deep aspect \u000aof the specimen consists of smooth fascia. The deep aspect is inked black. \u000aThe superficial aspect is inked blue. The specimen is serially sectioned to \u000areveal white fibroglandular tissue admixed with yellow fatty tissue. No \u000adiscrete mass lesions are grossly identified. 10 agg. \u000aSection code:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - nipple and areolar skin \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  &  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - upper outer quadrant \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  &  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - lower outer quadrant \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  &  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - lower inner quadrant \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  &  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - upper inner quadrant \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - central breast parenchyma \u000aSpecimen C labeled "left chest wall skin" is received fresh and consists of a \u000aring shaped piece of skin with attached soft tissue measuring 7 x up to 1.5cm  \u000ax 0.5cm  in depth. The skin surface is grossly unremarkable. A suture marks \u000athe lateral direction and will be designated as the 3 o'clock position. The \u000aspecimen is represented as follows. 4 agg. \u000aSection code:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - 12 o'clock \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - 3 o'clock \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - 6 o'clock \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - 9 o'clock \u000aSpecimen D labeled "left breast" is received fresh and consists of a mastectomy \u000aspecimen that weighs 241 grams and measures 17 x 15 x 1.5cm  The attached \u000anipple and areola complex measures 3.5cm  in diameter. The nipple measures \u000a1.5cm  in diameter. Both are grossly unremarkable. The deep aspect of the \u000aspecimen consists of smooth fascia. The deep aspect is inked black and the \u000asuperficial aspect is inked blue. Serial sectioning reveals white \u000afibroglandular parenchyma admixed with yellow adipose tissue. No discrete mass \u000alesions are grossly identified. \u000aSection code:  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - nipple and areolar skin \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  &  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - upper outer quadrant \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  &  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - lower outer quadrant \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  &  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - lower inner quadrant \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  &  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - upper inner quadrant \u000a REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  - central breast parenchyma \u000aDictated by: JLF____(signature on file)____ REMOVED_DATE (Final) \u000a[report_end] 
