he superior end is in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID , the \u000ainferior end is in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID ). 16 agg. all. \u000aSpecimen B labeled "cephalad additional superior margin" consists of a REMOVED_DATE x \u000a2.5 x 1.3cm  portion of fibroadipose tissue. One surface appears to be convex \u000aand this surface is inked. The specimen is cross-sectioned and entirely \u000asubmitted in  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID . 6 agg. all. \u000aDictated by: DDK____(signature on file)____ REMOVED_DATE (Final) \u000a____(signature on file)____RICHARD SAMPSON, M.D. REMOVED_DATE (Final) \u000a[report_end] 
